panero (0.1.0~preview.2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Second preview (git tag v0.1.0-preview.2).
  * Sidebar toggle at the far left of the toolbar; Trash button menu with
    Open Trash / Empty Trash; one Details | Thumbnails toggle.
  * Resizable Pinned / Folders split; drag folders onto Pinned.
  * Folder tree starts at Home (or the drive / "/") or at "/".

