panero (0.1.0~preview.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First Panero preview release (git tag v0.1.0-preview.1), based on
    Krusader 2.8.1.
  * Own application identity (io.github.norbcraft.panero): executable,
    desktop entry, AppStream metainfo, icons, configuration, data and
    private KIO worker directory, so Panero installs next to krusader;
    optional import of Krusader settings.
  * Commander input model: cursor and marks independent, short right click
    marks, holding the right button opens the native context menu.
  * Appearance: light/dark following the desktop, alternating rows,
    adjustable row height, red marks with check badge, framed cursor row,
    View & Colors dialog; Thumbnails view with KIO previews.
  * Navigation sidebar with pins and folder tree; drive selector labels;
    simplified default toolbar.
  * Compare by content with KDiff3, with an offer to install it through
    PackageKit.
  * Fixes: Restore/Empty Trash for trash:/ items, pack types without
    first-run setup; 39 fixes backported from Krusader 2.9.0/master,
    including ISO images on Ubuntu 24.04 and several crashes.

 -- Norbert Szabo <349977413+NorbCraft@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:20:11 +0100
